      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The destination delivery handover for two‑wheelers and motorcycles is a critical checkpoint that guarantees the vehicle reaches the consignee in the exact condition documented at pickup. By combining a daylight visual re‑inspection, precise odometer verification, and a formal signed condition sign‑off, the process eliminates disputes, protects both parties, and creates a clear audit trail.</p>

